  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.1.0 Upgrades the bundled apexsankey core to 1.11.0 (the animated relaunch: spring relayout and data morph, focus/isolate, draggable nodes, particle flow, vertical orientation, circular links, alluvial and chord projections, theming, a plugin API, and comparison split-view). The upgrade is non-breaking: existing options keep working. The new core capabilities are available at the JS layer and can be surfaced in the C# model in a follow-up.",
